-- Status: UNVERIFIED
MODULE [demo]

THEOREM [square_nonneg]:
  GIVEN:
    - [hx]: $x$ is a real number
  CLAIM:
    $x^2 \geq 0$

PROOF OF [square_nonneg]:

  [1] CASE $x \geq 0$:
    [1.1] HAVE $x^2 = x \cdot x \geq 0$.
          BY [1.0], product of nonnegatives.
    [1] QED BY [1.1].

  [2] CASE $x < 0$:
    [2.1] HAVE $-x > 0$.
          BY [2.0], algebra.
    [2.2] HAVE $x^2 = (-x)^2 \geq 0$.
          BY [2.1], product of nonnegatives.
    [2] QED BY [2.2].

  [3] SHOW $x^2 \geq 0$.
      BY [1], [2].

  QED BY [3].
